<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0656_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">HUH? WHA...? I CAN’T HEAR YOU!\nConnection must be TRASH!\rGo somewhere else and try callin’\nagain! I’M YELLIN’ ’CAUSE I CARE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WASSUP?!\nOh, ayo, my bad for yellin’!\rI’m doin’ GREAT!\fI just did 400 push-ups!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know there’s some stronger Block\nBosses around.\fDON’T LOSE HEART! KEEP GOIN’!\fWHOOOO!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see... I’m free most Wednesday\nnights.\fGimme a call then, OK?\fMY WIFE GO TO BED AT 9.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo! I just finished trainin’!\nI’m DRIPPIN’!\fYou wanna scrap again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AIGHT!\rI’ll be waitin’ over at the Saffron\nDojo!\fDON’T TELL MY WIFE WHERE I AM!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">NOOOOOO!\nThat’s TERRIBLE!\fI’m gon’ go punch a waterfall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm... You just scrappin’ me, right?\nAin’t you got other plans?\fI can see through you. I trained my\feyes under a waterfall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fLook forward to it! I’ll bring\fsnacks! Secret snacks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">YO! CHUCK HERE!\nWHAT’S GOOD?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, didn’t we make plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fDon’t tell me you forgot?\fC’mon, man! I been stretchin’ for an\fhour!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I train under a poundin’\nwaterfall every day.\rGuess that’s why me and my wife been\nbeefin’ a lot lately.\rI was thinkin’ of takin’ her on a trip\nto say sorry...\r...THAT’S IT!\rI’ll take her to Tohjo Falls! What\nyou think? ANOTHER waterfall!\fShe’ll love it. She’ll hate it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I’m only gon’ say this once,\nbut I...\rI REALLY like sweets. They the BEST.\rAfter trainin’, I sneak behind my wife’s\nback and eat somethin’ sweet.\fI got cake hid in the Block. In the\fwaterfall. It’s waterproof cake.\rOh! Don’t tell my wife! PLEASE!\nSHE’S RIGHT HERE! ...Hi, honey!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lately my Block’s waterfall machine\nbeen glitchin’... AAAAAHH!\rBoomwhooshoowhooshoowhoosh\foowhooshoowhooshoowhoosh...!\r...Haa haaa haaaaa. My bad. The machine\nbroke and I got SOAKED.\fMy cake’s ruined. Don’t tell my wife.\rI’ll call you back!</language>
	</row>
</body>
